changes.what:
The DOS-108 view-switch spec. It reads the screen's source rather than rendering it, following frontend/sales-app/src/order-entry-layout.test.ts:
- node:fs and node:url come in through non-literal specifiers;
- paths go through `fileURLToPath`, because the repo path has a space;
- comments are stripped with its `withoutComments` before matching;
- the file sits under src/, because expo-router treats every file in app/ as a route.
Assertions on app/settings/index.tsx:
- the element carrying testID="settings-view" is a `<Chips` whose items are built from SETTINGS_VIEWS;
- no `<Segments` carries testID="settings-view";
- SETTINGS_VIEWS has four ids, including 'support';
- every labelKey is a key of `strings` from ./strings (strings.ts imports nothing).
